{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Mechas are marching</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The human race is attacking the Vampire kingdom, this is nothing new and has happened countless times before. What makes this moment different is that the Humans are using Mechs to lead an all-out attack in hopes of exterminating the Vampires once and for all. They attacked the 6 Vampire strongholds with overwhelming numbers and superior technology. Some of the vampires have been taken prisoner and you must help!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554370/extras/2.gif?t=1741001120\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Side-Scrolling Platformer Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nixxsz Vampires vs Mechas is an action platformer with \u201cbullet hell\u201d features. This will keep you on your toes as you will need to be quick and precise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554370/extras/4.gif?t=1741001120\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Color-coded mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During your adventure you will encounter enemies, platforms and special attacks in blue or red.  You deal more damage to enemies of the same color, but take double damage from anything of the opposite color. You need to be quick not only to dodge the projectiles, but to increase the efficiency in destroying the mechs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554370/extras/5.gif?t=1741001120\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Bosses </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each stage, face powerful mech bosses with mechanic-intensive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554370/extras/neutralMechaz0rSuperIdle.gif?t=1741001120\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554370/extras/neutralMechaz0rSuperRun.gif?t=1741001120\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554370/extras/neutralMechaz0rSuperAttack.gif?t=1741001120\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554370/extras/neutralMechaz0rSuperDeath.gif?t=1741001120\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3554370?t=1741001120","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554370/f62198216863dabae8e1e9b9548343c56a9935fc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741001120","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554370/37844ebc7e09a1b6f608ff656d42049c08161039/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741001120","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554370/37844ebc7e09a1b6f608ff656d42049c08161039/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741001120","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Mechas are marching</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The human race is attacking the Vampire kingdom, this is nothing new and has happened countless times before. What makes this moment different is that the Humans are using Mechs to lead an all-out attack in hopes of exterminating the Vampires once and for all. They attacked the 6 Vampire strongholds with overwhelming numbers and superior technology. Some of the vampires have been taken prisoner and you must help!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554370/extras/2.gif?t=1741001120\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Side-Scrolling Platformer Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nixxsz Vampires vs Mechas is an action platformer with \u201cbullet hell\u201d features. This will keep you on your toes as you will need to be quick and precise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554370/extras/4.gif?t=1741001120\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Color-coded mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During your adventure you will encounter enemies, platforms and special attacks in blue or red.  You deal more damage to enemies of the same color, but take double damage from anything of the opposite color. You need to be quick not only to dodge the projectiles, but to increase the efficiency in destroying the mechs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554370/extras/5.gif?t=1741001120\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Bosses </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each stage, face powerful mech bosses with mechanic-intensive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554370/extras/neutralMechaz0rSuperIdle.gif?t=1741001120\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554370/extras/neutralMechaz0rSuperRun.gif?t=1741001120\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554370/extras/neutralMechaz0rSuperAttack.gif?t=1741001120\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets